   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## <span style=\"color:red\"> I. Errors that do not raise an error </span>\n",
    "\n",
    "<font size = \"4\">\n",
    "\n",
    "A syntax error stops you before you start. A runtime error stops you in the middle. Both of them are, in a real sense, *doing you a favor*: they hand you a line number and an error type, and last class you learned how to read them.\n",
    "\n",
    "A **silent error** gives you none of that. The cell runs. It prints. The answer is wrong.\n",
    "\n",
    "Python is not going to help you here. Nobody is. You have to build the alarm yourself, and the rest of this notebook is about how."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
